# ==============================================================================
# Trivy Exception Register
# ==============================================================================
#
# Add suppressions only after documenting:
# - the affected component;
# - why the finding is not exploitable or is temporarily accepted;
# - the responsible owner;
# - and an expiration or review date.
#
# Prefer VEX or narrowly scoped exceptions over permanent global CVE ignores.
